.TH codex-desktop 1 "May 2026" "codex-desktop 0.2.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
codex-desktop \- launch the Electron desktop path for Ubuntu
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B codex-desktop
[\fIarguments\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B codex-desktop
launches the Electron desktop path for Ubuntu using the locally installed app
root for the current user.
.PP
If no local app root exists yet, run:
.PP
.B codex-desktop-bootstrap
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/codex-ubuntu/electron.env
User-local Electron launcher configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/opt/codex-ubuntu/current/codex-app
Default local desktop payload location.
